===Etymology 1===
Inherited from {{inh|hi|psu||*𑀆𑀮𑀼𑀕}}, from {{inh|hi|sa|आलुक||elephant foot yam}}, which is from {{m|sa|आलु}} {{inc-ext|hi|ka}}. {{doublet|hi|आलु|आलुक}}. The word was used in the sense "potato" after the importation of potatoes to South Asia from the Americas by Europeans, displacing cultivation of the similar elephant foot yam.

